        "text_iknDbz": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Rebel Nell's pieces are set with a fragment of reclaimed material, so whatever you pick up has a real story behind it. Our Father's Day jewelry leans on sturdy materials like stainless steel, pewter, and metal alloy bases, so it's built to keep up with whatever your dad gets into. Whether you're shopping for a sports fan, a sharp dresser, a host, or the guy who insists he doesn't need anything, you'll find something here that feels personal. Browse our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"shop all jewelry\">full unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to put real craft and meaning behind every piece we make. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every piece, so each one carries both the history of its material and a story of opportunity along with it. Read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"read our story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and read our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"read our reviews\">customer reviews</a>. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
